      "id": "framing",
      "status": "instruction-backed",
      "finding": "The selected arm64 code reads a four-byte length then an input payload guarded to 1..1048576 bytes, parses a JSON dictionary and dispatches by type; output serialization writes a four-byte length and JSON under a lock.",
