      "status": "source-and-instruction-traced",
      "finding": "Request code loads connection.json beneath the declared Application Support base, checks port 1..65535 and a string token, builds POST http://127.0.0.1:<port>/mcp with Bearer and JSON headers, and packages JSON-RPC2.0 tools/call with session/profile arguments.",
