        "POST": "0x1000030c4..0x1000030d4"
      },
      "limits": [
        "The user connection file and credential value were never read; server-side authorization remains separate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "poll",
      "status": "source-traced",
      "finding": "After hello, the dispatch closure calls browser_poll repeatedly. Missing result emits ready/selected:false/app:false and sleeps two seconds. A result emits ready with selected status and app:true and can forward an optional dictionary to extension stdout.",
